  "description": "The meme constitutes antisemitic hate speech by using derogatory language ('jolo', 'jew only live once') to dehumanize and vilify Jewish people. This type of speech is protected under hate speech laws in many countries and is a direct expression of antisemitism. Understanding this requires knowledge of antisemitic discourse and its harmful impact.",
